# REQUIREMENTS: cu-002

Deliver criteria 2, 3, 5, 6 and 10 in the application layer. Add a pre-evaluation admissibility check that fails closed on a gate below the inclusive 0.85 floor or a blank justification, leaving Bayesian math and GREEN/RED/BLOCKED semantics otherwise unchanged. Build the cumulative LedgerStageReport as a pure function of the input hypothesis, the decision and the prior decision history. Depends on: cu-001 (report types and justification field).
